            "title": "光通信股逆市升   中際旭創入科指曾升逾7%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">光通信相關股今早逆市升，中際旭創(03308)一度升7.24%，報513元，成交5.36億元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"中際旭創官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/03308-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"中際旭創官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/03308-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">中際旭創官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中際旭創獲納入科指成份股，市場預期指數基金、ETF及主動型基金需按新成份股配置；同時公司提出20億至40億元人民幣回購建議。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">其他光通信股跟升，舜宇光學(02382)升2.22%，報59.8元; 劍橋科技(06166)升2.23%，報55.05元；東山精密(02384)曾升逾4%，現升幅收窄至0.4%，報87.15元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">今早港股同期A股CPO概念回升，新易盛升逾6%，中京電子漲停，反映市場對AI網絡、光模組及PCB等硬件供應鏈的需求預期重新轉趨樂觀。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中際旭創是高速光模組龍頭，直接受惠於AI數據中心對800G／1.6T光互連的擴產與升級預期；東山精密則因PCB及精密製造業務與AI伺服器、通信設備產業鏈相關，同樣被視為AI硬件景氣回暖的受惠股。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">公司早前公布首三季度淨利潤按年增長211.81%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17242431-%e5%85%89%e9%80%9a%e4%bf%a1%e8%82%a1%e9%80%86%e5%b8%82%e5%8d%87-%e4%b8%ad%e9%9a%9b%e6%97%ad%e5%89%b5%e5%85%a5%e7%a7%91%e6%8c%87%e6%9b%be%e5%8d%87%e9%80%be7",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/03308-Web3.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 10:02:27",
