            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "醫渡科技中期業績扭虧為盈 股價初段逆市微升",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">醫渡科技(02158)上日傍晚派中期成績表，成功扭虧為盈；該股今早低開後迅速反彈，初段暫時逆市微升。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"醫渡科技官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/11/02158-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"醫渡科技官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/11/02158-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">醫渡科技官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">截至上午約9時55分，該股報2.055元，升0.24%，成交243萬元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">該公司宣布，截至2026年9月底止半年錄得公司擁有人應佔利潤5,655萬元(人民幣．下同)；去年同期則有虧損1460.2萬元。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">期內收入3.77億元，按年升5.3%；毛利1.29億元，則按年倒退4.1%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17242456-%e9%86%ab%e6%b8%a1%e7%a7%91%e6%8a%80%e4%b8%ad%e6%9c%9f%e6%a5%ad%e7%b8%be%e6%89%ad%e8%99%a7%e7%82%ba%e7%9b%88-%e8%82%a1%e5%83%b9%e5%88%9d%e6%ae%b5%e9%80%86%e5%b8%82%e5%be%ae%e5%8d%87",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/06/02158.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 10:02:28",
